From: Mir Mohammad Sajedul Islam <mohammad.sajedul.islam@g.bracu.ac.bd>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 06:44:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix admin overview crash on timezone-aware timestamps

Some timestamp columns in the live database come back timezone-aware, and
comparing them with a plain UTC "now" raised a TypeError, so the admin
overview returned a server error. All date columns now use a type that
returns plain UTC whatever the database column is, and the subscription
helpers normalise their inputs as well.
